{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22116","headline":"秋居书怀 · 白居易","name":"秋居书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前少宾客，阶下多松竹。\n秋景下西墙，凉风入东屋。\n有琴慵不弄，有书闲不读。\n尽日方寸中，澹然无所欲。\n何须广居处，不用多积蓄。\n丈室可容身，斗储可充腹。\n况无治道术，坐受官家禄。\n不种一株桑，不锄一壠谷。\n终朝饱饭餐，卒岁丰衣服。\n持此知媿心，自然易爲足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}